    {
      "name": {
        "value": "DEATHSHIP",
        "scale": 0.9
      },
      "notes": [
        {
          "height": 30,
          "title": {
            "value": "DESCRIPTION",
            "scale": 1.0
          },
          "note": {
            "value": "<div style=\"font-size:20px;padding:4px 8px\"><i>Glowing tendrils of mist cover a friendly ship and produce an illusion around the ship which makes the ship even more frightening than it already is. The stench of death surrounds the ship and enemy sailors refuse to go near it.</i></div>",
            "scale": 1.0
          }
        },
        {
          "height": 15,
          "title": {
            "value": "CASTING VALUE",
            "scale": 1.0
          },
          "note": {
            "value": "<div style=\"font-size:20px;padding:4px 8px\">4+</div>",
            "scale": 1.0
          }
        },
        {
          "height": 55,
          "title": {
            "value": "EFFECT",
            "scale": 1.0
          },
          "note": {
            "value": "<div style=\"font-size:20px;padding:4px 8px\"><b>Cast On:</b> Any single friendly ship<br><br>The ship may not be attacked this turn in any way.</div>",
            "scale": 1.0
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": {
        "value": "CURSE OF YEARS",
        "scale": 0.8
      },
      "notes": [
        {
          "height": 30,
          "title": {
            "value": "DESCRIPTION",
            "scale": 1.0
          },
          "note": {
            "value": "<div style=\"font-size:20px;padding:4px 8px\"><i>The Necromancer calls upon the most powerful magic he knows and hurls an ancient curse at an enemy ship. The ship's crew are aged and die due to this hideous curse.</i></div>",
            "scale": 1.0
          }
        },
        {
          "height": 15,
          "title": {
            "value": "CASTING VALUE",
            "scale": 1.0
          },
          "note": {
            "value": "<div style=\"font-size:20px;padding:4px 8px\">6+</div>",
            "scale": 1.0
          }
        },
        {
          "height": 55,
          "title": {
            "value": "EFFECT",
            "scale": 1.0
          },
          "note": {
            "value": "<div style=\"font-size:20px;padding:4px 8px\"><b>Cast On:</b> Any single enemy ship<br><br>Roll a D6 for each crew counter on the ship. On a 5 or 6 the crew are aged and die. If there are any crew left alive after the roll, in the next magic phase roll again but this time subtract -1 from the roll required to kill them, by a maximum of 2-6. This spell may be dispelled in the same way as it would normally be done (see main text).</div>",
            "scale": 1.0
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": {
        "value": "LEG BONE CONNECTED TO THE KNEE BONE",
        "scale": 0.6
      },
      "notes": [
        {
          "height": 30,
          "title": {
            "value": "DESCRIPTION",
            "scale": 1.0
          },
          "note": {
            "value": "<div style=\"font-size:20px;padding:4px 8px\"><i>The Necromancer reaches out and knits the two damaged bones together to heal a ship of some damage it has suffered. The damaged arm works as if new.</i></div>",
            "scale": 1.0
          }
        },
        {
          "height": 15,
          "title": {
            "value": "CASTING VALUE",
            "scale": 1.0
          },
          "note": {
            "value": "<div style=\"font-size:20px;padding:4px 8px\">4+</div>",
            "scale": 1.0
          }
        },
        {
          "height": 55,
          "title": {
            "value": "EFFECT",
            "scale": 1.0
          },
          "note": {
            "value": "<div style=\"font-size:20px;padding:4px 8px\"><b>Cast On:</b> Any friendly ship which has damaged locations<br><br>Completely repairs two locations which have been damaged.</div>",
            "scale": 1.0
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": {
        "value": "HORDE OF THE GRAVE",
        "scale": 0.7
      },
      "notes": [
        {
          "height": 30,
          "title": {
            "value": "DESCRIPTION",
            "scale": 1.0
          },
          "note": {
            "value": "<div style=\"font-size:20px;padding:4px 8px\"><i>The Necromancer utters an age old incantation and proceeds to summon the horde of the grave. The horde will arrive clattering and desperate to get into action.</i></div>",
            "scale": 1.0
          }
        },
        {
          "height": 15,
          "title": {
            "value": "CASTING VALUE",
            "scale": 1.0
          },
          "note": {
            "value": "<div style=\"font-size:20px;padding:4px 8px\">6+</div>",
            "scale": 1.0
          }
        },
        {
          "height": 55,
          "title": {
            "value": "EFFECT",
            "scale": 1.0
          },
          "note": {
            "value": "<div style=\"font-size:20px;padding:4px 8px\"><b>Cast On:</b> Any single friendly ship<br><br>You may add D6 + 2 Skeletons to any ship in your fleet provided it does not take them over the crew limit of the ship. Any crew which cannot fit on a ship are lost in the void.</div>",
            "scale": 1.0
          }
        }
      ]
    },
