          "note": {
            "value": "<div style=\"font-size:20px;padding:4px 8px\"><i>In a shower of magic a Spirit Wraith appears and rushes across the sky towards the enemy. The Wraith drops on to the deck of the ship, licks up some crew and departs again to the world of night.</i></div>",
            "scale": 1.0
          }
